---
import { policyDates } from '../data/legal';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="InsureFacts provides general factual information only. It is not financial advice, and we are not an insurer, agent or broker. Read the full disclaimer."
  lead={site.disclaimerShort}
  updated={policyDates.disclaimer}
  ads={false}
>
  <h2>Information only</h2>
  <p>
    The content on InsureFacts ({site.domain}) is general, factual information about how insurance
    works in the United States, the United Kingdom, Canada and Australia. It is provided for
    educational purposes only.
  </p>

  <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website is financial advice or a financial product recommendation, whether
    personal or general. The information does not take into account anyone’s objectives, financial
    situation or needs, and it should not be relied on as the only basis for any decision. We never
    recommend a particular insurer, policy or product.
  </p>

  <h2>We are not an insurer, agent or broker</h2>
  <p>
    InsureFacts does not sell, arrange or deal in insurance and is not an insurance company, agent or
    broker. We are not authorised by the Financial Conduct Authority (FCA) in the UK, and we do not
    hold an Australian Financial Services Licence from the Australian Securities and Investments
    Commission (ASIC). We are not licensed to give advice by any US state or Canadian provincial or
    territorial regulator.
  </p>

  <h2>Check before you decide</h2>
  <p>
    Insurance rules, prices and products change, and they can differ by state, province or territory.
    Although we base our articles on official sources and try to keep them accurate and up to date, we
    can’t guarantee that every page is complete, accurate or current. The terms of an actual policy are
    set by the insurer’s policy documents, not by this website.
  </p>
  <p>
    Before making any decision, check the details with the insurer or the relevant official source.
    You may also wish to speak to a licensed professional.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to official sources and other websites for reference. We aren’t responsible for their
    content, which may change after we link to it.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    Ads on this website are served by Google AdSense and are labelled “Advertisement”. An ad appearing
    on InsureFacts is not an endorsement or recommendation of the advertiser or its products.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, {site.name} and its operator are not liable for any loss or damage
    arising from the use of, or reliance on, information on this website. Nothing in this disclaimer
    limits any rights you have that cannot be excluded or limited under the law that applies to you.
  </p>

  <p>
    Questions about this disclaimer can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    See also our <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.
  </p>
</ContentPage>
